{"id":"ivfurkdzsa4qlyxtzhraefrdm","title":"美联储加息言论转向鹰派","originalTitle":"Fed Speak Turns Hawkish","summary":"美联储官员加息言论趋鹰，CPI数据推动市场预期。芝加哥联储主席Goolsbee称服务通胀未缓解，费城联储Paulson指出AI需求推高价格，达盛银行预计12月加息25基点，德意志银行预判1月再加息。市场已反映12月暂停加息预期，但就业数据和CPI超预期削弱了等待空间。","reason":"CPI数据推动市场对加息预期变化，不同官员对通胀成因的表述差异影响政策路径判断。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha"},"links":{"original":"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4966359-fed-speak-turns-hawkish?source=feed_all_articles"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T11:56:12.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T12:01:10.916Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T12:01:10.916Z","category":"macro","tags":["监管处罚","美联储","通胀"],"score":87,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"fed","name":"美联储 / Fed"},{"slug":"rates","name":"利率与流动性"},{"slug":"inflation","name":"通胀与就业"},{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}